  "id": "ecovoice/canada-energy-supply-and-demand",
  "title": "Canada\u2019s Energy Future 2023: Energy Supply and Demand Projections to 2050",
  "description": "Canada's Energy Future 2023 (EF2023) is the Canada Energy Regulator's long-term outlook of national energy supply and demand projections from 2000 to 2050, covering electricity, crude oil, natural gas, hydrogen, and other energy carriers. It models three scenarios\u2014Current Measures, Canada Net-zero, and Global Net-zero\u2014with the latter two representing pathways to net-zero GHG emissions by 2050. Data are disaggregated by province/territory and energy type across 20 CSV files.",
